comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T22:35:36.062Z",codex-agent,"PR #27 extends this issue regression protection to the new criterion coverage path. Substantive attributed allowance/quota/rate-limit counter findings remain eligible through real SDK and registered review cover; genuine quota-exhausted/skipped/unavailable/rate-limit-reached notices remain refused. The topic-wide denylist was narrowed to service-notice phrases, with an isolated revert proof. Work and verification are tracked on pm-review-criterion-coverage-map. This does not change or certify the existing round-completion classifier; this issue remains open."
  "2026-10-23T07:29:39.916Z",codex-agent,"Confirmed completion uses a separate raw substring denylist. Plan: source minimal public provider notice excerpts; reproduce unavailable false positives and substantive rate-limit false negatives through evaluator and registered round/status with real non-git trackers; reuse the actionable-aware classifier while preserving exact-head/state/author gates."
  "2026-10-23T07:44:00.780Z",codex-agent,"Initial unchanged-code replay reproduced false completion for quota exhausted, no repository access, action not completed, failed generation and disabled automatic reviews; the severity-marked rate-limit finding was incorrectly incomplete. Added a 16-case evaluator plus actual registered round/status matrix using real plain-directory trackers, no git executable, synthetic read-only GitHub responses, exact host exits and unchanged durable history assertions. Public minimal CodeRabbit and Greptile excerpts retain their comment/review URLs. Copilot public fleet notice provenance has not been found; no substitute is labeled as Copilot."
  "2026-10-23T07:45:25.013Z",codex-agent,"Implementation replaces only the completion denylist with isReviewNotice, leaving CodeRabbit bot identity, exact commit and accepted submitted states unchanged. Local typecheck, lint, zero-duplication gate (52 sources), and docstring gate (103 declarations) passed. Targeted runtime checks are still running; full release evidence will come from the existing Node 22/26 npm and Bun CI gates with unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-23T07:48:05.752Z",codex-agent,"Public fixture audit read complete comment/review pagination for 41 public fleet PR candidates (82 successful endpoints) returned by the Copilot/review search, plus direct provider probes. No Copilot-authored body was available in that corpus, so Copilot fixture provenance remains an explicit evidence gap. Existing CodeRabbit and Greptile excerpts are verified. Fresh-HOME strict tracker health passed; ordinary local health detected only global pm-github/host version skew. No dependency pins or global settings changed."
  "2026-10-23T07:50:30.741Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: restored only coderabbitFinished to its original raw denylist, leaving all fixtures and tests unchanged. node --test --test-name-pattern='exact-head completion: (Quota exhausted|rate-limit finding|CodeRabbit notice alongside substantive finding)$' test/exact-head-completion.test.ts exited 1: 0 passed, 3 failed, 0 skipped. Quota incorrectly returned true; both substantive cases incorrectly returned false. Restored the fix. The complete fixed matrix previously passed 16/16 with 0 skips; running it again through the linked pm test command now."
  "2026-10-23T07:52:01.279Z",codex-agent,"Existing focused runtime suite passed 78/78, 0 failed, 0 skipped: node --test test/core.test.ts test/github.test.ts test/review-regressions.test.ts test/respond.test.ts. New completion matrix passed 16/16 before the function-only revert; all 3 selected regressions failed with the old function. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and isolated strict tracker health passed. The linked pm execution is checking the restored fix before handoff."
  "2026-10-23T07:54:03.862Z",codex-agent,"Restored-fix verification through the required linked runner passed: pm test pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-14 --run --progress --timeout 900 executed node --test test/exact-head-completion.test.ts with 16 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped, exit 0. Combined focused validation is 94 passing tests across the new matrix and existing four-file suite. All three function-only revert regressions failed as expected. Preparing the ready-for-review PR; full npm/Bun release gates will run in CI."
  "2026-10-23T07:55:53.838Z",codex-agent,"Ready-for-review PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/34 at fc939035199a5e0ad92691a4b30c37fe42e3ceab. Full npm/Bun release CI is running: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39921019251. Revert proof, 94 focused passing tests, exact source changes and public fixture provenance are committed together. No merge or release requested; the item remains in progress pending orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-23T08:02:00.756Z",codex-agent,"Full release CI passed on fc939035199a5e0ad92691a4b30c37fe42e3ceab: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39921019251. Node 22 npm: 211 tests plus 1 packed npm/Bun acceptance test; Node 26 npm: 211 plus 1; Node 26 bun run release:check: 211 plus 1. Each suite has 0 failures and 0 skips. All four coverage dimensions are 100% across 30 reported sources; duplication is 0% across 52 sources and all 103 declarations have docstrings. Strict CI tracker health, typecheck, lint, audit, packing, changelog and publish-attestation checks passed. CodeQL also passed. Handoff commit will contain tracker receipts and claim release only; final PR-head CI will be checked again. Copilot notice provenance remains the documented fixture gap."
